{"2311270": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Vicious Cycles: Rally", "steam_appid": 2311270, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>HIGH SPEED ARENA COMBAT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2311270/extras/37e4cf01779537c6047a99fefc05ed97.poster.avif?t=1784603726\" width=768 height=432 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2311270/extras/37e4cf01779537c6047a99fefc05ed97.webm?t=1784603726\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2311270/extras/37e4cf01779537c6047a99fefc05ed97.mp4?t=1784603726\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Vicious Cycles: Rally is a fast based combat game where armed motorcycles face off in explosive arena battles  </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ride the walls, find powerful weapons, and chase down your friends as battle motorcycles in this fast-paced vehicle shooter! Will you claim sweet victory, or burn out?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Local split-screen and couch versus couch online play!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2311270/extras/83def950551a22cc3f230578a976ca9a.poster.avif?t=1784603726\" width=768 height=432 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2311270/extras/83def950551a22cc3f230578a976ca9a.webm?t=1784603726\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2311270/extras/83def950551a22cc3f230578a976ca9a.mp4?t=1784603726\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather your crew for up to 4-player local split-screen, or head online to clash with rival rallies!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The entire arena is your battleground!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2311270/extras/b494835dd1f33ff0849984e1c72e4e25.poster.avif?t=1784603726\" width=768 height=432 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2311270/extras/b494835dd1f33ff0849984e1c72e4e25.webm?t=1784603726\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2311270/extras/b494835dd1f33ff0849984e1c72e4e25.mp4?t=1784603726\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chase your opponents up on the walls and ceiling! The action doesn't stop till one of you is a wreck!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Colorful futuristic arenas!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2311270/extras/a26e0d3b522586ca51a656af347aa839.poster.avif?t=1784603726\" width=768 height=432 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2311270/extras/a26e0d3b522586ca51a656af347aa839.webm?t=1784603726\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2311270/extras/a26e0d3b522586ca51a656af347aa839.mp4?t=1784603726\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle in vibrant futuristic arenas as you compete to be the crowd favorite!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explosive arsenal!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2311270/extras/ba248ac636845ad1646dfff5966a67ab.poster.avif?t=1784603726\" width=768 height=432 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2311270/extras/ba248ac636845ad1646dfff5966a67ab.webm?t=1784603726\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2311270/extras/ba248ac636845ad1646dfff5966a67ab.mp4?t=1784603726\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wield a diverse array of weapons to obliterate the competition and take the win by force! From energy weapons like the laser cannon to explosive weapons like the rocket launcher, reach victory by whatever means necessary!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Try different game types!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from a variety of PVP and PVE game modes from traditional deathmatch, to the mayhem of co-op swarm mode!</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>HIGH SPEED ARENA COMBAT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2311270/extras/37e4cf01779537c6047a99fefc05ed97.poster.avif?t=1784603726\" width=768 height=432 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2311270/extras/37e4cf01779537c6047a99fefc05ed97.webm?t=1784603726\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2311270/extras/37e4cf01779537c6047a99fefc05ed97.mp4?t=1784603726\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Vicious Cycles: Rally is a fast based combat game where armed motorcycles face off in explosive arena battles  </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ride the walls, find powerful weapons, and chase dow